---
import DetailLayout from "../layouts/DetailLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../consts";
---
<DetailLayout seoTitle="Privacy Policy - Guilin & Yangshuo Travel Guide" title="Privacy Policy" subtitle="What this site collects (very little) and how it's used." description="Privacy policy for the Guilin & Yangshuo Travel Guide: Google Analytics for aggregate traffic only, no ads, no accounts, and we never sell personal data.">
  <p class="text-sm text-[#5c5a4c]/70">Last updated: <time datetime={SITE.dateModified}>September 16, 2026</time></p>

  <h2>The Short Version</h2>
  <p>This is a static travel guide. We don't ask you to log in, we don't run advertising networks, and we don't sell or share any personal information. The only analytics we run is Google Analytics (privacy-modeled, cookie-based) to understand roughly how many people read each page and where they came from.</p>

  <h2>What We Collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Google Analytics (gtag.js):</strong> aggregate, non-identifying usage data — pages viewed, approximate country, device type, and referrer. We use it only to see which guides are useful. No personally identifiable information is stored by us.</li>
    <li><strong>Email you send us:</strong> if you write to us, we keep the message so we can respond and act on corrections. We never publish your address without permission.</li>
    <li><strong>Server/CDN logs:</strong> Cloudflare, which hosts this site, records standard request metadata (IP, user agent) for security and rate-limiting. This is governed by Cloudflare's own policy, not something we control.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>Google Analytics may set cookies to distinguish unique visitors. You can block these via your browser settings or a blocker like uBlock Origin without breaking the site — all content works with cookies disabled.</p>

  <h2>What We Do Not Do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No ad networks or third-party advertising trackers.</li>
    <li>No selling, renting, or sharing of personal data.</li>
    <li>No user accounts, forms, or collection of payment details.</li>
    <li>No tracking pixels from social platforms.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>External Links</h2>
  <p>We link to official sources (immigration, weather, railways) and Wikipedia. Those sites have their own privacy policies; clicking away means you leave our site and this policy no longer applies.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about privacy? Email us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</DetailLayout>
